+<section id="s-idea" data-nav="The idea" class="sec--sand">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <span class="chip rv"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-inf"/></svg> One glyph, three readings</span>
+    <h2 class="h1 rv" style="margin-top:.9rem">Why an eight.</h2>
+    <div class="means">
+      <div class="mean rv" data-d="1">
+        <div class="mean__top"><span class="mean__n"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-turn"/></svg></span>
+          <span><span class="mean__k">Reading 01</span><b>The turn</b></span></div>
+        <span class="t">Rotate the 8 ninety degrees and it becomes the infinity sign. Age stops being a count and becomes a line with no end. The whole brand promise sits in a quarter turn, which is also the entire logo brief.</span>
+      </div>
+      <div class="mean rv" data-d="2">
+        <div class="mean__top"><span class="mean__n"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-loop"/></svg></span>
